  "fullContentHtml": "<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-b39c368c\">\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-60ccea19 gb-headline-text\"><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; height: 225px;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 36px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 22.6212%; text-align: center; height: 36px; border-style: none;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Name Of Post :</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 77.3788%; height: 36px; border-style: none;\">\n<h1>UP Police Sub Inspector SI Advt No 03/2025 Recruitment 2025 Exam Date 2026 for 4543 Post</h1>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 22px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 22.6212%; text-align: center; height: 35px; border-style: none;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Post Date / Update :</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 77.3788%; height: 35px; border-style: none;\">17 June 2026 | 06:51 PM</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 154px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 22.6212%; text-align: center; height: 154px; border-style: none;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information </strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 77.3788%; height: 154px; border-style: none; vertical-align: middle;\">\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Uttar Pradesh Police Recruitment &amp; Promotion Board (UPPRPB) has released Sub Inspector SI Daroga Recruitment Notification. Those candidates who are Enrolled in this UP Police SI Exam 2026 can Check the Exam Date and Download Result. Read the notification for recruitment eligibility, post information, selection procedure, Practice Test, pay scale and all other information.</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"social-grid\">\n\n<div class=\"social-box telegram\">\n    <div class=\"social-left\">\n        <img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/2111/2111646.png\">\n        <span>Telegram</span>\n    </div>\n    <a href=\"https://t.me/SarkariResult2012\" class=\"social-btn\">Join Us</a>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"social-box whatsapp\">\n    <div class=\"social-left\">\n        <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/733/733585.png\">\n        <span>WhatsApp</span>\n    </div>\n    <a href=\"https://www.whatsapp.com/channel/0029Va5IElwBlHpVBd6i5a18\" class=\"social-btn\">Join Us</a>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"social-box instagram\">\n    <div class=\"social-left\">\n        <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/2111/2111463.png\">\n        <span>Instagram</span>\n    </div>\n    \n</div>\n\n<div class=\"social-box twitter\">\n    <div class=\"social-left\">\n        <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/5968/5968958.png\">\n        <span>X</span>\n    </div>\n    <a href=\"https://x.com/srofficial2012\" class=\"social-btn\">Follow</a>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div id=\"v-sarkariresult\"></div>\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-48617a69 gb-headline-text\"><table border=\"1\" width=\"760\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"14\" valign=\"top\" width=\"620\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Uttar Pradesh Police Recruitment &amp; Promotion Board</b></span></h2>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><b><span style=\"color: #008000;\">UP Police Sub Inspector SI Recruitment 2025</span></b></h2>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>UPP Advt. No. 03/2025 : Short Details of Notification</b></span></h2>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><b></b></span><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"8\" valign=\"top\" width=\"347\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span><b></b></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Application Begin :<b> 12/08/2025</b></li>\n<li>Last Date for Apply Online :<span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><b>11/09/2025</b></span></li>\n<li>Last Date Pay Exam Fee :<b>11/09/2025</b></li>\n<li>Form Correction : <strong>12/09/2025 to 15/09/2025</strong></li>\n<li>Exam Date:<strong>14-15 March 2026</strong></li>\n<li>Exam City Available : <b>06/03/2026<br>\n</b></li>\n<li>Admit Card Available : <b>3 Days Before Exam<br>\n</b></li>\n<li>Answer Key Available : <b>23/03/2026<br>\n</b></li>\n<li>Result Available : <b>07/05/2026<br>\n</b></li>\n<li>DV / PST Exam Date : <b>15-16 June 2026<br>\n</b></li>\n<li>DV / PST Admit Card : <strong>05/06/2026</strong></li>\n<li>Re Print Form Link Available : <strong>12/06/2026</strong></li>\n<li>SI PET Exam Date : <strong>29 &amp; 30 June 2026</strong></li>\n<li>SI PET Reserve Day Date : <strong>01/07/2026</strong></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"273\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span><b></b></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>General / OBC / EWS : <b>500/-</b></li>\n<li>SC / ST : <b>400/-</b></li>\n<li>Pay the Examination Fee Through Cast at E Challan or Debit Card, Credit Card, Net Banking<b> </b></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"14\" valign=\"top\" width=\"620\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>UP Police Sub Inspector SI Notification 2025 : <span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\">Age Limit as on </span></b><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>01/07/2025</b></span></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Minimum Age :<strong> 21 Years</strong></li>\n<li>Maximum Age : <strong>28 Years</strong></li>\n<li>Age Relaxation Extra as per UP Police Sub Inspector SI Recruitment Rules.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"14\" valign=\"top\" width=\"620\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>UP Police Sub Inspector SI Recruitment 2025: <span style=\"color: #008000;\">Vacancy Details </span></b><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Total : 4543 Post</b></span></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"125\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>Post Name</b></p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"159\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>Total Post</b></p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"8\" valign=\"top\" width=\"336\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>UP Police Sub Inspector SI Eligibility</b></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"125\">\n<p align=\"center\">UP Police Sub Inspector Civil Police (Male / Female)</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"159\">\n<p align=\"center\">4242</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"8\" valign=\"top\" width=\"336\">\n<ul>\n<li>Bachelor Degree in Any Stream from Any Recognized University in India.</li>\n<li>More Eligibility Details Read the Notification.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"125\">\n<p align=\"center\">Platoon Commander PAC</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"159\">\n<p align=\"center\">135</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"8\" valign=\"top\" width=\"336\">\n<ul>\n<li>Bachelor Degree in Any Stream from Any Recognized University in India.</li>\n<li>More Eligibility Details Read the Notification.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"125\">\n<p align=\"center\">Platoon Commander Special Force</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"159\">\n<p align=\"center\">60</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"8\" valign=\"top\" width=\"336\">\n<ul>\n<li>Bachelor Degree in Any Stream from Any Recognized University in India.</li>\n<li>More Eligibility Details Read the Notification.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"125\">\n<p align=\"center\">Sub Inspector Female Battalion</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"159\">\n<p align=\"center\">106</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"8\" valign=\"top\" width=\"336\">\n<ul>\n<li>Bachelor Degree in Any Stream from Any Recognized University in India.</li>\n<li>More Eligibility Details Read the Notification.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"14\" valign=\"top\" width=\"620\"><center><br>\n<!-- 300 x 250 mar 23 --><br>\n<br>\n</center><p></p>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>How to Fill UP Police Sub Inspector SI Recruitment Online Form 2025</b></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>UP Police Sub Inspector SI Recruitment for Various Post Candidate Can Apply Between <strong>12/08/2025 to 11/09/2025</strong></li>\n<li>Candidate Read the Notification Before Apply the Recruitment Application Form in UP Police Sub Inspector SI Recruitment 2025.</li>\n<li>Kindly Check and Collect the All Document – Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</li>\n<li>Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to Recruitment Form – Photo, Sign, ID Proof, Etc.</li>\n<li>Before Submit the Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</li>\n<li>If Candidate Required to Paying the Application Fee Must Submit. If You have Not the Required Application Fees Your Form is Not Completed.</li>\n<li>Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"14\" valign=\"top\" width=\"620\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Interested Candidates Can Read the Full UP Police Sub Inspector SI Exam 2025 Notification Before Apply Online</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"14\" valign=\"top\" width=\"620\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\" width=\"328\">\n\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\" width=\"292\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"14\" valign=\"top\" width=\"620\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Some Useful Important Links</b></span><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"7\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Download PET Exam Schedule</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"7\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><a title=\"UP Police SI Pet Exam Date\" href=\"https://uppbpb.gov.in/FilesUploaded/Notice/img20260617_173601189e86b2a6-e914-4405-b700-2dd2e09425ba.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>Click Here</b></a></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"7\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Download DV / PST Admit Card</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"7\">\n<h2 align